OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will be a
OL,6,Fcloudy evening with outbreaks of light
OL,7,Fand patchy rain continuing. Remaining
OL,8,Fcloudy overnight with rain becoming
OL,9,Fconfined to the southwest and the east
OL,10,Fdrier.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FThe east will be dry with
OL,13,Fbright and sunny spells. Cloudier in
OL,14,Fthe west with light rain possible in
OL,15,Fthe morning, drier with some brighter
OL,16,Fspells developing in the afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
