OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FA few
OL,6,Fshowers in the east Friday, otherwise
OL,7,Fmostly dry and cold Friday and
OL,8,FSaturday with some long sunny spells
OL,9,Fand overnight frost. Dry on Sunday.
